        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pierre Bouvier, Chantal Claret\n- Bands: Simple Plan, Morningwood\n- Songs: \"I'm Just a Kid\"\n- Albums: The One, The Only...\n- Companies: The End Records\n- Places: New York\n- Studios: Studio Edison\n\nFacts:\n- Pierre Bouvier was born on 9 May 1979.\n- Pierre Bouvier is a Canadian singer, songwriter, musician, composer, and actor.\n- Pierre Bouvier is best known as the lead singer and guitarist of the rock band Simple Plan.\n- \"I'm Just a Kid\" is the debut single by Simple Plan, and Pierre Bouvier wrote it.\n- Chantal Claret is best known as the lead singer of the rock and power pop band Morningwood.\n- On June 19, 2012, Chantal Claret released her debut album The One, The Only... through The End Records.\n- The album The One, The Only... was recorded at Studio Edison in New York.",
